AK41213501-F100-03-05	Vitra Eames Lounge Ottoman rahi, American cherry - Nubia cream-sand	Vitran Eames Lounge Ottoman -rahi on Charles ja Ray Eamesin vuonna 1956 suunnitteleman ikonisen Lounge Chairin tyylikäs kumppani. Lounge Ottoman jakaa saman sulavalinjaisen muotokielen ja korkealaatuiset materiaalit Lounge Chairin kanssa.\nIkonisen tuolin ja rahin pehmusteena toimivat yleensä nahkaverhoillut istuintyynyt, mutta kun Eames-nojatuoli julkaistiin alun perin 1950-luvulla, oli siitä hetken aikaa saatavilla myös kangasverhoiltu versio. Vuonna 2023 Vitra toi kankaalla verhoillun nojatuolin ja rahin takaisin markkinoille, tällä kertaa ihanan eläväisellä Nubia-bukleekankaalla viimeisteltynä.	2025.00	https://www.finnishdesignshop.fi/fi-fi/tuote/eames-lounge-ottoman-rahi-american-cherry-nubia-cream-sand	https://media.fds.fi/product_image/7012443_Eames-Lounge-Chair-Ottoman_master_sourceVitra.jpg	- Iconic\n- Stylish\n- High-quality\n- American cherry\n- Nubia cream-sand\n- Bouclé fabric\n- Classic\n- Modern\n- Comfortable\n- 1950s\n- Timeless\n- Upholstered\n- Eames\n- Vitra\n- 2023	Based on the description, the Vitra Eames Lounge Ottoman is an elegant and high-quality piece of furniture designed to complement the iconic Lounge Chair by Charles and Ray Eames. Here are possible use-cases for this product:\n\n1. **Home Office**\n2. **Living Room Decor**\n3. **Relaxation Space**\n4. **Reading Nook**\n5. **Footrest**\n6. **Lounge Chair Companion**\n7. **Luxury Furniture Collection**\n8. **Office Waiting Area**\n9. **Stylish Home Accents**\n10. **Guest Seating Arrangement**	[0.014255282,-0.01527158,-0.029540412,0.014472092,0.032684162,-0.027860131,-0.018008811,0.027683973,0.007507059,-0.030922579,0.031193592,0.008611437,-0.005779351,-0.031139389,-0.0048240307,0.053064335,0.0038449962,-0.035258785,-0.0017166977,0.019553585,0.001723473,0.067644835,-0.018320475,0.012039751,0.054717515,0.05187188,-0.025231306,-0.030028235,-0.018239172,-0.01693831,-0.0021664097,-0.021979151,0.01247337